  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Plant companion class feature, know at least one limited-uses-per-day plant companion talent</p>\n<p>Your plant companion has learned to move its body in such a way that it protects you, particularly when performing its fancier maneuvers.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever your plant companion uses a plant companion talent with a limited number of uses per day, you gain DR 1/- and resistance 1 against acid, cold, electricity, fire, and sonic for 1 round. This stacks with all other sources of damage reduction and resistance, save itself.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
